{
  "name": "Enrich B2B Domains with Verified Contacts, SaaS /pricing Tiers & /llms.txt Briefs",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`website-contacts-socials-pricing-llm-brief-api` \u2014 500 free req/mo).\n2. Create a Generic Header Auth credential named **RapidAPI Key** (`x-rapidapi-key`).\n3. Put your prospect domains or work emails in **Set Prospect List**.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c0cdad75-2b25-4a4f-a3e1-8dcc8794c6c8",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Deduplication & WAF Protection\n- Cross-format duplicates (`stripe.com` and `ceo@stripe.com`) are deduplicated automatically.\n- WAF-blocked domains return a clean `error` while preserving DNS `emailProvider` \u2014 routed cleanly to the fallback branch.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "277f5877-4bb5-481c-953f-688121be4f7b",
      "name": "Built-in Hygiene",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "6b13bea0-aac4-4f02-8727-f3645a4b42e7",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a58efafb-fef3-44e4-a6b4-4fbc73a1ad86",
              "name": "domains",
              "value": "={{ ['stripe.com', 'linear.app', 'posthog.com', 'webflow.com'] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3c61d165-a750-48db-9cfc-84da4ebab5c8",
      "name": "Set Prospect List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://website-contacts-socials-pricing-llm-brief-api.p.rapidapi.com/enrich",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-rapidapi-host",
              "value": "website-contacts-socials-pricing-llm-brief-api.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: $json.domains }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2ea689-471f-4212-9fd1-f41a34cb32d4",
      "name": "Batch Enrich Company Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        60
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "results",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dbd4a20f-deb6-435f-ac18-acfab054359f",
      "name": "Split Out Enriched Companies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "41f132de-1058-4e4d-8c90-743ae14ac8a5",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "0db3ff71-c914-41f3-bc5e-a14c6f4ec3dc",
      "name": "Filter Reachable Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bf331565-442f-462d-a52d-6efdd3508b1a",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1399c5e3-e36a-4e1b-9c6c-f8288fe53056",
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "52ad6ce2-84cf-4330-a656-856d791427b3",
              "name": "primaryEmails",
              "value": "={{ $json.primaryEmails || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "065e98ff-4ef2-4fe4-989b-51309d4bbe5b",
              "name": "socials",
              "value": "={{ $json.socialLinksSummary || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "42174371-3dee-4748-b94e-8290279ed5cf",
              "name": "pricingSummary",
              "value": "={{ $json.pricingSummary || 'None' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f81a1cd2-2cbd-4a31-8c70-fa1b0259acc2",
              "name": "emailHost",
              "value": "={{ $json.dns?.emailProvider || 'Unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "6128f718-ad92-41af-aaba-e97c49053620",
              "name": "briefSource",
              "value": "={{ $json.briefSource || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "433686a3-3157-4387-95cb-15482197c684",
      "name": "Format Enriched Prospect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#lead-enrichment"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.companyName + ' (' + $json.domain + ') | Emails: ' + ($json.primaryEmails || 'None') + ' | Pricing: ' + $json.pricingSummary + ' | Mail: ' + $json.emailHost + ' | Brief: ' + $json.briefSource }}"
      },
      "id": "92ac5a03-fee1-4e74-a481-38c4e139b2fa",
      "name": "Send Enriched Brief to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        0
      ]
    }
